{title: Now Thank We All Our God}
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}

{start_of_verse: 1}
Now [C]thank we [F]all our [C]God[**] with [Dm]heart and [G]hands and [F]voic[C]es
Who [C]wondrous [F]things hath [C]done[**] in [Dm]whom his [G]world re[F]joi[C]ces
Who [G]from our [C]mother's [G]arms[**] hath [C]blessed us [Am]on our [Em]way[**]
With [Am]countless [Dm]gifts of [F]love[**] and [Dm]still is [G]ours to[C]day[**]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
O [C]may this [F]bounteous [C]God[**] through [Dm]all our [G]life be [F]near [C]us
With [C]ever-[F]joyful [C]hearts[**] and [Dm]blessed [G]peace to [F]cheer [C]us
And [G]keep us [C]in his [G]grace[**] and [C]guide us [Am]when per[Em]ple[**]xed
And [Am]free us [Dm]from all [F]ills[**] in [Dm]this world [G]and the [C]next[**]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
All [C]praise and [F]thanks to [C]God[**] the [Dm]Father [G]now be [F]gi[C]ven
The [C]Son and [F]Holy [C]Ghost[**] su[Dm]preme in [G]highest [F]heav[C]en
The [G]one e[C]ternal [G]God[**] whom [C]earth and [Am]heaven a[Em]dore[**]
For [Am]thus it [Dm]was is [F]now[**] and [Dm]shall be [G]ever[C]more[**]
{end_of_verse}
